{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）中午11時56分，警方接報荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓有樹枝由高處墮下，打中一名長者的頭部。據報樹枝約6米長、5厘米直徑，女傷者半清醒由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。人員到場圍封現場調查，案件暫列有人暈倒處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"瑪嘉烈醫院（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194266435094843392507469.jpeg/DDBQVVN6TdvhXElzw4H7CEKWCcAnhloxyk49AMpOPQA\"/><figcaption>瑪嘉烈醫院（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:31.227409+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:36:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:38:58.631834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:38:58.631834+00:00","content_hash":"6a5909fe008f96a99b9751c02c986b2086570b113ba624dd3e13d28dfd8bfe33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}